SUMMARY:Life Long Learning: Saturday Night Live: 50 Years Through a Jewish Lens
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 50 years of Saturday Night Live through its unforgettable Jewish writers\, performers\, and sketches\, featuring classic video clips with Jon Lovitz\, Adam Sandler\, Billy Crystal\, Andy Samberg\, Jerry Seinfeld\, and many more. \nAbout the speaker: After a distinguished career at IBM\, Al Kustanowitz became an author\, speaker\, and founder of Jewish Humor Central. He has written eleven books and presents engaging multimedia programs on Jewish humor\, entertainment\, television history\, and popular culture nationwide. \nFREE for JCC Member; $15 Nonmember\n$80 guest pass for the semester\n \nRegister Here\n  \nSponsored by:
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/lll-saturday-night-live/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Enrichment
