SUMMARY:Shofar Factory
DESCRIPTION:Shofar Factory\nAt this workshop\, participants will learn how to select a suitable horn\, then see how it is cut\, drilled\, polished\, and finished to create a beautiful\, functional instrument. The experience culminates with learning to blow the shofar and practicing the traditional calls and notes of Rosh Hashanah. \nLocation: JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall \nCost: $12 per shofar (pay in advance by 9/14)\nOPEN TO THE COMMUNITY \nLight refreshments will be served \nRegister Here\nSupported by the Cooperman Foundation and Jewish Federation of Greater MetroWest NJ
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/shofar-factory/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children and Family
