SUMMARY:The Ear to Brain Connection Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn how hearing loss\, tinnitus\, and brain health are connected.\nPresented by Rhee Nesson\, Au.D.\, expert speaker\, author\, Certified Dementia and Tinnitus practitioner\, and Founder of Hearing Doctors of New Jersey. \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415.
