SUMMARY:Movement\, Strength\, and Health Through Hormonal Change Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to move with confidence through perimenopause and menopause. This workshop explores how hormonal changes impact strength\, energy\, and recovery\, and how to adapt your fitness routine to support bone health\, muscle mass\, and overall well-being. Leave with practical\, sustainable strategies to feel strong and resilient at every stage. \nLed by Samantha Moir\, PT\, DPT\, OCS\, CSCS\, a Board-Certified Orthopedic Physical Therapist\, Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist\, and Certified Tennis Performance Trainer. \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415. \n  \nSponsored by
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/movement-strength-health/
