SUMMARY:Women’s Health and Hormones Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Your sleep has changed. Your energy isn’t the same. Your body feels different.\nAlthough your doctor says everything is normal\, it doesn’t feel that way. \nJoin Dee Pentyala\, Ayurvedic Health Counselor and Wellness Practitioner\, for an immersive\, hands-on workshop where you’ll have an honest conversation about your hormones-like estrogen\, progesterone\, cortisol\, and thyroid-in plain\, everyday language. Through guided discussion\, real-life tools\, and interactive exercises\, you’ll understand why your body is doing what it’s doing and leave with practical changes around food\, movement\, stress\, and sleep that you can start tomorrow. \nFree and open to the public / Registration required \nRegister\n  \nFor more information: Ellen Robertson\, erobertson@jccmetrowest.org or (973) 530-3415.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/health-hormones/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Wellness
