SUMMARY:Life Long Learning: 39th Annual Shirley C. Green Memorial Symposium - Israel Update and October 7th Commemoration with Daniella Gefen
DESCRIPTION:Daniella Gefen\, Shlicha for the Jewish Federation of Greater MetroWest NJ\, will be providing the Israel Update as well as coordinating an October 7 commemoration. She was born in Jerusalem to parents who immigrated from England and Iran. A former IDF educator and licensed clinical social worker\, she has dedicated her career to Israel education and cross-cultural engagement. Since October 7\, she has supported displaced and reservist families while leading\neducational initiatives. \nFREE to all. Reservations strongly encouraged.\nRefreshments to follow. \nRegister Here\n  \nSponsored by: \n \n  \nRefreshments sponsored by: \n \nThe annual Shirley C. Green Memorial Symposium is presented in recognition of her life-long devotion and efforts on behalf of Israel. The program is made possible through the generosity of the late Walter Green.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/lll-shirley-c-green-39/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Enrichment
