SUMMARY:Book Group: Brian Schaefer
DESCRIPTION:Town & Country by Brian Schaefer\nSpanning one election season in a rapidly changing small town\, Town & Country is an insightful\, character-driven novel that explores the intersections of politics\, love\, faith\, and community with empathy and wit. A richly layered novel about community\, identity\, and belonging. \nBook group discussion at 12:00 PM\nAuthor presentation at 1:00 PM \nBook Group discussion and conversation with the author will be available either in person or on Zoom for participants; author will present via Zoom. \nFREE for Members; $15 Nonmember \nRegister Here\n\nIn partnership with: \n         
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/book-group-brian-schaefer/
